<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Defs_L3_2_2_2" targetNamespace="https://teck.example/process-models/pillar-02">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collab_L3_2_2_2">
    <bpmn:participant id="Pool_L3_2_2_2" name="2.2.2 Loading" processRef="Process_L3_2_2_2"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_L3_2_2_2" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>L0/L1/L2/L3 Process. Core value-adding cycle at the dig face: trucks arrive, queue, spot, receive payload from shovel, payload verified, destination assigned. Payload measurement via strut pressure sensors is the primary mass data source. The haul cycle event record is initiated here.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_L3_2_2_2">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_2_2_2_tk" name="Truck Operator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_L3_2_2_2_s</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_2_2_2_sv" name="Shovel Operator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_2_2_2_fm" name="Mine Controller / FMS">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gw_L3_2_2_2_g</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_2_2_f</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_2_2_2_e</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_L3_2_2_2_s" name="Truck dispatched to face">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_2_1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_1" name="2.2.2.1 Queue Truck at Shovel">
      <bpmn:documentation>Truck arrives at the dig face and enters a queue. Wait time is classified as Operating Delay (OD) if brief and inherent to operations, or Operating Standby (SBO) if queue length reflects a management decision (excess truck fleet, face access constraint). FMS records queue entry and exit timestamps per truck per face visit.
ISA-95 level: 3 / 2
Actors: Truck Operator; Mine Controller
Standard alignment: GMG TUM (OD or SBO — critical distinction; must be explicitly classified per event); ISA-95 Level 3
DDVC layer: Raw; Curated (delay_event with TUM classification)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_2_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_2_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_2" name="2.2.2.2 Spot Truck at Shovel">
      <bpmn:documentation>Truck leaves the queue and manoeuvres to the loading position alongside the shovel. Spotting time begins from queue exit and ends at first bucket contact. This is Non-Productive Operating Time (NP) — the truck is in Operating Time but not yet receiving a load. FMS detects spotting completion via GPS proximity and/or shovel operator confirmation.
ISA-95 level: 0 / 1
Actors: Truck Operator; Shovel Operator
Standard alignment: GMG TUM (NP — spotting manoeuvre); GMG Mobile Equipment Open Data
DDVC layer: Raw</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_2_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_2_3</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_3" name="2.2.2.3 Load Truck with Shovel">
      <bpmn:documentation>Shovel operator excavates material from the dig face and deposits into the truck body in successive bucket passes (typically 3–5 passes). Truck body strut pressure sensors record incremental payload accumulation in real time (1-second telemetry). This is Productive Time (PT) for the shovel and Working Time (WT) for the truck. [COPPER NOTE: Rope shovels 20–55 m³ bucket at QB/HVC. ZINC NOTE: Hydraulic excavators more common at Red Dog given deposit geometry.]
ISA-95 level: 0 / 1
Actors: Shovel Operator; Truck Operator
Standard alignment: GMG TUM (PT for shovel, WT for truck); GMG Mobile Equipment Open Data (strut pressure, pass count)
DDVC layer: Raw (time-series: haul_truck_strut_telemetry); Curated (haul_cycle)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_2_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_2_4</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_4" name="2.2.2.4 Verify Payload and Issue Dispatch">
      <bpmn:documentation>FMS calculates estimated payload from strut pressure readings and compares against nominal capacity (overload/underload thresholds). Mine controller or FMS auto-assigns destination based on material classification for that dig face zone. Truck receives destination on cab display. Dispatch record (truck ID, shovel ID, material type, payload, destination, timestamp) written to FMS — this is the haul cycle initiation event.
ISA-95 level: 2 / 3
Actors: Mine Controller; FMS (auto-dispatch)
Standard alignment: GMG TUM (WT ends; OT continues to destination); ISA-95 Levels 2, 3
DDVC layer: Raw; Curated (haul_cycle)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_2_4</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_2_5</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_L3_2_2_2_g" name="Payload in tolerance?" default="Flow_L3_2_2_2_6">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_2_5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_2_6</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_2_7</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_2_2_f" name="Flag payload exception for review">
      <bpmn:documentation>Derived from the Process Flow Narratives section (not a row in the Process Decomposition).</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_2_7</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_2_8</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_2_2_2_e" name="Haul cycle initiated">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_2_6</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_2_8</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_2_1" sourceRef="Start_L3_2_2_2_s" targetRef="Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_2_2" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_1" targetRef="Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_2_3" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_2" targetRef="Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_3"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_2_4" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_3" targetRef="Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_4"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_2_5" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_4" targetRef="Gw_L3_2_2_2_g"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_2_6" name="Yes" sourceRef="Gw_L3_2_2_2_g" targetRef="End_L3_2_2_2_e"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_2_7" name="No" sourceRef="Gw_L3_2_2_2_g" targetRef="Task_L3_2_2_2_f"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_2_8" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_2_2_f" targetRef="End_L3_2_2_2_e"/>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_L3_2_2_2">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_L3_2_2_2" bpmnElement="Collab_L3_2_2_2">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Pool_L3_2_2_2_di" bpmnElement="Pool_L3_2_2_2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="20" y="20" width="1426" height="710"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_2_2_2_tk_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_2_2_2_tk" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="20" width="1386" height="200"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_2_2_2_sv_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_2_2_2_sv" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="220" width="1386" height="200"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_2_2_2_fm_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_2_2_2_fm" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="420" width="1386" height="310"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_L3_2_2_2_s_di" bpmnElement="Start_L3_2_2_2_s"><dc:Bounds x="110" y="87" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="88" y="149" width="100" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_1_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_1"><dc:Bounds x="202" y="75" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_2_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_2"><dc:Bounds x="408" y="75" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_3_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_3"><dc:Bounds x="614" y="275" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_4_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_2_2_2_2_2_2_4"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="475" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Gw_L3_2_2_2_g_di" bpmnElement="Gw_L3_2_2_2_g" isMarkerVisible="true"><dc:Bounds x="1026" y="480" width="70" height="70"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1011" y="446" width="100" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_2_2_2_f_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_2_2_2_f"><dc:Bounds x="1160" y="600" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_2_2_2_e_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_2_2_2_e"><dc:Bounds x="1366" y="487" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1344" y="453" width="100" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_2_2_1_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_2_2_1"><di:waypoint x="166" y="115"/><di:waypoint x="202" y="115"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_2_2_2_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_2_2_2"><di:waypoint x="372" y="115"/><di:waypoint x="408" y="115"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_2_2_3_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_2_2_3"><di:waypoint x="578" y="115"/><di:waypoint x="596" y="115"/><di:waypoint x="596" y="315"/><di:waypoint x="614" y="315"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_2_2_4_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_2_2_4"><di:waypoint x="784" y="315"/><di:waypoint x="802" y="315"/><di:waypoint x="802" y="515"/><di:waypoint x="820" y="515"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_2_2_5_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_2_2_5"><di:waypoint x="990" y="515"/><di:waypoint x="1026" y="515"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_2_2_6_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_2_2_6"><di:waypoint x="1096" y="515"/><di:waypoint x="1366" y="515"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1100" y="495" width="28" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_2_2_7_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_2_2_7"><di:waypoint x="1061" y="550"/><di:waypoint x="1061" y="640"/><di:waypoint x="1160" y="640"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1067" y="556" width="21" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_2_2_8_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_2_2_8"><di:waypoint x="1330" y="640"/><di:waypoint x="1394" y="640"/><di:waypoint x="1394" y="543"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
